<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tenneco &quot;Featured Stock&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tenneco &quot;Featured Stock&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Boston said it named Tenneco Inc as its &quot;Featured Stock of the Week.&quot;</p>
<p>-- raised the 12-month price target to $53 from $45.</p>
<p>-- Tenneco gained 1/2 to 45-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
